several other disks)
Full duplex switched Fast Ethernet (DE500)

Both runnng inn-1.5.1 and using innfeed 0.10.1.4 (although using a
different version of innfeed makes no difference)

'news' takes numerous external news feeds, and is then responsible
for forarding them on to our internal news machines, of which 'leaf'
is one.

