Subject: SUMMARY: Matlab AND patch duv40aas00002-19970505
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96078613510457

Thanks to Toni Harbaugh-Blackford, and David Warren for their
replies.  Matlab now have a fix for the licence manager to allow it to
work under the DU patch.  

The solution is to retrieve the files

lmgrd.512a
lm_matlab.512a

from ftp.mathworks.com in /pub/tech-support/outgoing. 

Put them in $MATLAB/etc/alpha and replace the older versions, e.g.
  # mv lmgrd lmgrd.50a
  # mv lm_matlab lm_matlab.50a
  # mv lmgrd.512a lmgrd
  # mv lm_matlab.512a lm_matlab

Everything works fine under the new patch once done.

thanks again,
Andrew
