hi osf-managers,

The way to backup NFS mounted filesystems is to 

specify each file system to be backed up in "Save set:" in the Client setup( /, /usr,/usr1 
etc...)

It can't work with the "all" option:

"The "All" specification applies *only* to local filesystems".

