   I want to run the NFS service on my AlphaServer,I write the exported
directories in the file /etc/exports,then I start the nfs daemon.Now I
can mount the exported nfs directory on the same machine,but when I
connect to a nfs client on Win95 using NFS client software,or a Netware
server running NFS2.1 servie,the client or the Netware server can not
mount the directories that exported on the AlphaServer.
