Hi,

I've solved it by renaming /sbin/vdump to /sbin/vdump.exe and using
the following script for /sbin/vdump:

#!/bin/sh
_RLD_LIST="/shlib/libc.so.prejava:/shlib/libmsfs.so"
export _RLD_LIST
exec /sbin/vdump.exe $*

Additionally the old pre-java libc.so should be in /shlib/libc.so.prejava
Apparently setting LD_LIBRARY_PATH is not enough as I've tried it
in my first attempt to use the old libc.so.

Tom

